{"nodes": [{"id": "docs_prd_erp_manufaktur_pipa_prd_document", "label": "PRD ERP + MES Manufaktur Pipa v3.0", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "docs/PRD-ERP-Manufaktur-Pipa.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "v3.0 takes the existing application's database schema as its basis: table and field names are preserved verbatim and ALTERed only where ERP criteria demand, so migration from the legacy app does not require renaming."}, {"id": "docs_prd_erp_manufaktur_pipa_erp_mes_landscape", "label": "ERP + MES System Landscape (14 Modules)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/PRD-ERP-Manufaktur-Pipa.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_prd_erp_manufaktur_pipa_single_database_ab_erp", "label": "Single MySQL Database `ab-erp` for ERP and MES", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/PRD-ERP-Manufaktur-Pipa.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The reference diagram's ERP-DB/MES-DB split is deliberately collapsed into one database so BOM, Master Item, WOS and WO are read directly with no cross-database sync, cache tables or outbox; the accepted trade-off is that an ERP/API outage takes MES down too, mitigated by HA MySQL plus the terminal offline queue."}, {"id": "docs_prd_erp_manufaktur_pipa_tech_stack", "label": "Tech Stack (Laravel 11 / React 18 / MySQL 8 / Redis)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/PRD-ERP-Manufaktur-Pipa.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_prd_erp_manufaktur_pipa_serial_tracking", "label": "Serial Number Traceability (RM 1:pcs, PM 1:lot)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/PRD-ERP-Manufaktur-Pipa.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Serials are generated up-front at GR creation (status GENERATED) so the GR document and QR labels can be printed before physical inspection; actual length/weight are captured later and all corrections (OK/NG/VOID) happen inside the GR, which keeps the master item free of locked weight/length values."}, {"id": "docs_prd_erp_manufaktur_pipa_dual_uom", "label": "Dual UoM for Pipe RM (length mm + weight kg)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/PRD-ERP-Manufaktur-Pipa.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Each serial carries remaining_length and remaining_weight in parallel so consumption, costing and quota realisation can all be driven by actually measured values rather than master conversion factors."}, {"id": "docs_prd_erp_manufaktur_pipa_rm_flow", "label": "Raw Material Flow (MRP\u2192PR\u2192PO\u2192GRN\u2192QAS\u2192Invoice\u2192Cost Sheet)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/PRD-ERP-Manufaktur-Pipa.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_prd_erp_manufaktur_pipa_fg_flow", "label": "Finished Good Flow (MPS\u2192MPP\u2192WO\u2192Kanban\u2192MES\u2192FCS\u2192RFG\u2192DN\u2192Invoice)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/PRD-ERP-Manufaktur-Pipa.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_prd_erp_manufaktur_pipa_kuota_impor", "label": "Import Quota Control (ton per quota code)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/PRD-ERP-Manufaktur-Pipa.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Balance = total ton \u2212 open-PO reservation (estimate) \u2212 GRN realisation (actual). Import PO is hard-blocked when the balance is short (override only via a dedicated approval) because exceeding the customs quota is a regulatory breach, not a business preference; the estimate-vs-actual weighing difference auto-corrects the balance."}, {"id": "docs_prd_erp_manufaktur_pipa_scrap_rm", "label": "Scrap RM Candidate Rule (remaining < min BOM length)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/PRD-ERP-Manufaktur-Pipa.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Automatic flagging only proposes a candidate; the final decision stays manual and reversible in both directions (scrap \u21c4 usable) with a recorded reason, because BOMs change and an offcut deemed unusable today may fit a future part."}, {"id": "docs_prd_erp_manufaktur_pipa_operator_machine_rule", "label": "Operator/Machine Rule (cutting 1 user multi-machine; non-cutting max 2/2)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/PRD-ERP-Manufaktur-Pipa.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_prd_erp_manufaktur_pipa_fg_transfer", "label": "FG Transfer via spec_group", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/PRD-ERP-Manufaktur-Pipa.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Transfer between two FG codes is permitted only when spec_group matches, so physically identical stock can be re-badged for an urgent order without ever letting a different specification substitute silently; the move is approval-gated and carries value and lot traceability along."}, {"id": "docs_prd_erp_manufaktur_pipa_fg_downgrade", "label": "FG Downgrade (NG finished good back to material)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/PRD-ERP-Manufaktur-Pipa.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Rejected FG re-enters stock as material via a mapped RM/PM code with freshly re-measured length/weight; the value gap is booked as a reclassification journal to scrap/variance so inventory value never silently inflates."}, {"id": "docs_prd_erp_manufaktur_pipa_bom_multilevel", "label": "Multi-Level BOM (FG as PM of another FG)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/PRD-ERP-Manufaktur-Pipa.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_prd_erp_manufaktur_pipa_pricelist_periode", "label": "Period-Based FG Pricelist", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/PRD-ERP-Manufaktur-Pipa.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A Sales Order pulls the price valid on its own document date; with no active pricelist the line is blocked and can only proceed via approval override, preventing ad-hoc pricing."}, {"id": "docs_prd_erp_manufaktur_pipa_multi_vendor", "label": "Multi-Vendor per Material (priority, MOQ, lead time)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/PRD-ERP-Manufaktur-Pipa.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_prd_erp_manufaktur_pipa_subcont_portal", "label": "Subcontractor Portal & Virtual Location", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/PRD-ERP-Manufaktur-Pipa.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Goods sent out for outside processing move to a virtual location 'Subcont-{vendor}' rather than leaving stock, because ownership and inventory value stay with the company; PPh 23 is withheld on the service invoice."}, {"id": "docs_prd_erp_manufaktur_pipa_mes_offline", "label": "MES Offline Mode (PWA buffer + client_uuid idempotency)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/PRD-ERP-Manufaktur-Pipa.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Shop-floor scanning must not stop when the network drops, so payloads queue locally in IndexedDB keyed by client_uuid and replay on reconnect; server-side idempotency on that uuid is what makes replay safe against duplicates."}, {"id": "docs_prd_erp_manufaktur_pipa_ppn_pmk131", "label": "PPN under PMK 131/2024 (DPP Nilai Lain 11/12)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/PRD-ERP-Manufaktur-Pipa.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Non-luxury goods are taxed 12% on a 11/12 'other value' base (effective 11%); the rule is expressed as a per-tax-code formula with an effective date so a future rate change is configuration, not a code change."}, {"id": "docs_prd_erp_manufaktur_pipa_coretax_efaktur", "label": "e-Faktur / Coretax Integration", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/PRD-ERP-Manufaktur-Pipa.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_prd_erp_manufaktur_pipa_pph23_ebupot", "label": "PPh 23 Subcont & e-Bupot", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/PRD-ERP-Manufaktur-Pipa.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_prd_erp_manufaktur_pipa_landed_cost_sheet", "label": "Import Cost Sheet / Landed Cost per Actual Weight", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/PRD-ERP-Manufaktur-Pipa.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Freight, insurance, duty, import VAT, PPh 22 and PIB/EMKL charges are allocated by actual weighed kg rather than by quantity, because pipe bars vary in weight and cost per kg is the only stable unit for later consumption costing."}, {"id": "docs_prd_erp_manufaktur_pipa_cogm_costing", "label": "COGM / HPP Actual Costing per WO", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/PRD-ERP-Manufaktur-Pipa.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_prd_erp_manufaktur_pipa_rbac_2fa", "label": "Granular RBAC, Menu/User Privilege & TOTP 2FA", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/PRD-ERP-Manufaktur-Pipa.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_prd_erp_manufaktur_pipa_paperless_approval", "label": "Paperless Multi-Level Approval & Mobile Approval", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/PRD-ERP-Manufaktur-Pipa.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_prd_erp_manufaktur_pipa_planning_chain", "label": "Planning Chain Forecast\u2192MPS\u2192MPP\u2192MRP\u2192CRP\u2192WO/Kanban", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/PRD-ERP-Manufaktur-Pipa.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_prd_erp_manufaktur_pipa_final_check_sheet", "label": "Final Check Sheet (FCS / OQC traceability gate)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/PRD-ERP-Manufaktur-Pipa.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_prd_erp_manufaktur_pipa_kanban_issue", "label": "Kanban Material Issue & Return", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/PRD-ERP-Manufaktur-Pipa.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_prd_erp_manufaktur_pipa_wos_routing", "label": "Master WOS / Routing (cutting first, machine priority)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/PRD-ERP-Manufaktur-Pipa.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Pipe-part production always starts at Cutting, so routing sequence 1 is constrained to a cutting process whenever the BOM contains a per-pcs serialised RM; downstream steps consume WIP pallets rather than raw serials."}, {"id": "docs_prd_erp_manufaktur_pipa_general_store", "label": "General Store (non-material sparepart & consumable)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/PRD-ERP-Manufaktur-Pipa.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Sparepart issues are charged to a cost center and linked to a machine/asset so spare-part history per asset becomes an asset-control input; these items enter via a normal non-material GR without serials."}, {"id": "docs_prd_erp_manufaktur_pipa_db_schema_baseline", "label": "Existing Database Schema Baseline (m_/prc_/wh_/prd_/tr_ prefixes)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/PRD-ERP-Manufaktur-Pipa.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Legacy table and column names are kept verbatim (m_item, tr_cut_main, wh_out_main, \u2026) so the running application's data can be reused without a rename migration; new modules (sales, accounting, costing, asset) are added in the same naming style."}, {"id": "docs_prd_erp_manufaktur_pipa_roadmap", "label": "7-Phase Implementation Roadmap", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/PRD-ERP-Manufaktur-Pipa.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_prd_erp_manufaktur_pipa_ftpi_visual_identity", "label": "FTPI Visual Identity & UI/UX Direction", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/PRD-ERP-Manufaktur-Pipa.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Design tokens are extracted from the PT. Fusoh Tube Parts Indonesia site (clean Japanese corporate character, corporate blue and white) so the ERP shell reads as the customer's own system."}, {"id": "docs_prd_erp_manufaktur_pipa_nfr", "label": "Non-Functional Requirements (performance, availability, audit)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/PRD-ERP-Manufaktur-Pipa.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_prd_erp_manufaktur_pipa_user_stories", "label": "16 Key User Stories & Acceptance Criteria", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "docs/PRD-ERP-Manufaktur-Pipa.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_prd_erp_manufaktur_pipa_glossary", "label": "Domain Glossary (WOS, QAS, GRN, RFG, FCS, UMH, COGM)", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "docs/PRD-ERP-Manufaktur-Pipa.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}], "edges": [{"source": "docs_prd_erp_manufaktur_pipa_tech_stack", "target": "readme_laravel_framework", "relation": "references", "confidence": "INFERRED", "confidence_score": 0.95, "source_file": "docs/PRD-ERP-Manufaktur-Pipa.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_prd_erp_manufaktur_pipa_prd_document", "target": "docs_prd_erp_manufaktur_pipa_erp_mes_landscape", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/PRD-ERP-Manufaktur-Pipa.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_prd_erp_manufaktur_pipa_erp_mes_landscape", "target": "docs_prd_erp_manufaktur_pipa_single_database_ab_erp", "relation": "implements", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/PRD-ERP-Manufaktur-Pipa.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_prd_erp_manufaktur_pipa_serial_tracking", "target": "docs_prd_erp_manufaktur_pipa_dual_uom", "relation": "shares_data_with", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/PRD-ERP-Manufaktur-Pipa.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_prd_erp_manufaktur_pipa_rm_flow", "target": "docs_prd_erp_manufaktur_pipa_serial_tracking", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/PRD-ERP-Manufaktur-Pipa.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_prd_erp_manufaktur_pipa_rm_flow", "target": "docs_prd_erp_manufaktur_pipa_kuota_impor", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/PRD-ERP-Manufaktur-Pipa.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_prd_erp_manufaktur_pipa_rm_flow", "target": "docs_prd_erp_manufaktur_pipa_landed_cost_sheet", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/PRD-ERP-Manufaktur-Pipa.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_prd_erp_manufaktur_pipa_fg_flow", "target": "docs_prd_erp_manufaktur_pipa_kanban_issue", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/PRD-ERP-Manufaktur-Pipa.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_prd_erp_manufaktur_pipa_fg_flow", "target": "docs_prd_erp_manufaktur_pipa_final_check_sheet", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/PRD-ERP-Manufaktur-Pipa.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_prd_erp_manufaktur_pipa_kanban_issue", "target": "docs_prd_erp_manufaktur_pipa_rm_flow", "relation": "shares_data_with", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/PRD-ERP-Manufaktur-Pipa.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_prd_erp_manufaktur_pipa_scrap_rm", "target": "docs_prd_erp_manufaktur_pipa_bom_multilevel", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/PRD-ERP-Manufaktur-Pipa.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_prd_erp_manufaktur_pipa_planning_chain", "target": "docs_prd_erp_manufaktur_pipa_bom_mult